  <h1>Why Is My Lettuce Bolting Indoors? The Bitter Switch Nobody Warns You About</h1>
</article>
<figure class="hero">
  <img src="/images/hero-why-is-my-lettuce-bolting-indoors.jpg" alt="A lettuce plant in a white hydroponic tray under a slim LED bar light, growing a tall thin flower stalk with buds at the top" loading="eager" width="1344" height="768" />
